From c7d3df8585531f857a403b8011474ac909ce464f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:00:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Shimmy: FreeSO 61ed6d5, routing tests, cheat toggles, FreeSO
 auto-update

- tools/freeso.ref: Glamurio/FreeSO simitone 61ed6d5 (Sims and pets
  shimmy through narrow pinches between objects, FreeSO PR #1).
- Tests/Simitone.Routing.Tests: 18 geometry tests for VMShimmyPlanner,
  compiled against the FreeSO sources with XNA stubs; CI runs them before
  every build.
- UICheatTextbox: client commands "shimmy [on|off]" and
  "draw_routes [on|off]" (route debug overlay, shows pinches).
- tools/build.ps1: when FreeSO is not at the commit Simitone expects (e.g.
  after pulling a branch that moved the submodule), update it if that is
  safe: no uncommitted changes to tracked files, and the current commit is
  on a remote branch or an ancestor of the expected one. Otherwise warn
  and build it as it is. -KeepFreeSO skips the update.

Squashed from the feature/shimmy branch (PR #2).

